@startuml CQRS_Architecture
skinparam roundcorner 5
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
hide circle

title Kiến trúc CQRS (Command and Query Responsibility Segregation) trong Module

actor "Client (SPA / User)" as Client
component "Host API Endpoint" as API
interface "IModule Interface" as IModule

package "Write Model (Commands)" #E8F5E9 {
    component "Command\n(ICommand<TResult>)" as Command
    component "MediatR Pipeline\n(Decorators / Behaviors)" as Pipeline
    component "Command Handler\n(ICommandHandler)" as CmdHandler
    component "Domain Model\n(Aggregates, Entities, Events)" as Domain
    interface "IRepository" as Repo
    database "Outbox Table\n(OutboxMessages)" as Outbox
}

package "Read Model (Queries)" #E1F5FE {
    component "Query\n(IQuery<TResult>)" as Query
    component "Query Handler\n(IQueryHandler)" as QueryHandler
    component "Direct SQL / Dapper\n(Projection Engine)" as SQL
    component "Data Transfer Object\n(DTO)" as DTO
}

database "SQL Server Database\n(Module Schema)" as DB

Client --> API : HTTP Request
API --> IModule : ExecuteCommand / ExecuteQuery

IModule --> Command : [Write Operations]
Command --> Pipeline
Pipeline --> CmdHandler
CmdHandler --> Domain : Thao tác nghiệp vụ & Invariants
Domain --> Repo : Cập nhật trạng thái
Domain ..> Outbox : Ghi Integration Event
Repo --> DB : Transaction Commit (EF Core)

IModule --> Query : [Read Operations]
Query --> QueryHandler
QueryHandler --> SQL : Thực thi câu truy vấn
SQL --> DB : Read-Only SELECT (No tracking)
DB --> SQL : Raw data
SQL --> DTO : Map trực tiếp DTO
DTO --> Client : Trả về dữ liệu nhanh chóng

note bottom of Domain
  <b>Write Side:</b>
  - Tuân thủ nghiêm ngặt tính toàn vẹn nghiệp vụ
  - Sử dụng UnitOfWork & Transaction
  - Đẩy sự kiện qua Transactional Outbox
end note

note bottom of SQL
  <b>Read Side:</b>
  - Bỏ qua Aggregate Root overhead
  - Tối ưu hiệu năng đọc cao nhất
  - Trả về DTO trực tiếp cho giao diện
end note

@enduml
